  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAs">IV As</ref> 6.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Si regem vel archiepiscopum requirat vel sanctam Dei eccclesiam, habeat novem noctes de termino; et quærat quicquid quærat, non habeat vitam diutius, de quo vere palam erit, nisi capi non possit.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if he seeks the king, or the archbishop, or a holy church of God, he shall have respite for nine days; but let him seek [whomsoever or] whatever he may, unless he cannot be captured, he shall not be allowed to live longer, if the truth becomes known about him.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
